zac:51192_lot_36 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "36 —STONE STATUETTE OF WOMAN. Old Kingdom. From Palmyra. The legs have been cut off at the knees. The head wears a wig, beneath which the real hair appears on the forehead; the wig is short, and parted in the middle. The face is well-modelled, with an agreable expression; the body stands straight, the hips are narrow, and the arms hang by the sides." ;
