    rdfs:label """433 — IMPORTANT ENAMELLED RELIQUARY.\r
\r
Limoges,early I3th.century.\r
\r
Very beautiful reliquary, in the form of a figure of the Virgin, enthroned, with the Child on her left knee. The throne is richly decorated at the back and sides with figures of angels, and in front with designs, in champleve enamel.\r
\r
Ht.,14 1/2 inches.\r
\r
(Illustrated.)""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

