    rdfs:label """435\r
\r
—ENAMEL CROSS.\r
\r
With an engraved and gilt figure of Christ crucified, on a background beautifully enamelled, in rich colours. At the foot of the cross kneels a small nude female figure. In an excellent state of preservation.\r
\r
Ht.,133/4 inches.""" ;
