    rdfs:label "IMPORTANT BRONZE STATUETTE. IIrd. cent. B.C.  Hercules.  A nude and powerful figure, holding in his right hand a club, high above his head.  Light-green patina.  Ht.,8 3/4 inches.  His foot rests on the head of a lion." ;
