Head and shoulders portrait facing half-right; the body draped in a dark undergarment covered by a scarlet cloak edged at the neck with fur, on the head a low-crowned hat of dark green velvet trimmed with leather braid. The face that of a man of perhaps thirty, with brown eyes and long, vulpine nose.\r
\r
On wood:Height,1o inches;width,8 inches.\r
