    rdfs:label """## 13-MADONNA AND CHILD\r
\r
The Virgin is clad in blue and draped in a scarlet cloak, holding the Child, in a loose robe of light blue; the Infant is seated on a mossgreen velvet cloth spread over a stone table. A faience pot at the left holds flowers, of which the Child has plucked one with the right hand. An embrasure at the upper right in the paneled wall behind offers a view over wooded landscape beyond.\r
\r
On wood:Height,174 inches;width,121/2 inches. ##""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

