zac:5739_lot_25 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "JOOS VAN DER BEKE (Called JOOS VAN CLEVE THE ELDER)  Born in Antwerp 1520. Died 1556. THE HOLY VIRGIN WITH THE CHILD, SITTING ON A RICH THRONE OF MARBLE. The Madonna wears an ample dress of vivid red. The Child is playing with a coral rosary or necklace. Characteristic are the ornaments of the throne in the style of the Renaissance. Landscape in the background, on both sides. A very good picture from his studio.  Oak Panel:Height,20 inches;width,131 inches." ;
    crm:P102_has_title zac:5739_lot_25_title ;
