zac:5739_lot_25_description a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label """25-THE HOLY VIRGIN WITH THE CHILD, SITTING\r
\r
## ON A RICH THRONE OF MARBLE\r
\r
The Madonna wears an ample dress of vivid red. The Child is playing with a coral rosary or necklace. Characteristic are the ornaments of the throne in the style of the Renaissance. Landscape in the background, on both sides. A very good picture from his studio.\r
\r
Oak Panel:Height,20 inches;width,131 inches.\r
##""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

