zac:5739_lot_3_description a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label """3-TWO HORSEMEN WATERING THEIR HORSES AT A\r
\r
## FOUNTAIN NEAR A WALL OF ROCKS\r
\r
One has dismounted from his spotted white horse, the other,in a blue dress and a white turban, is mounted on a brown mare. In the right foreground a dog;in the distance a farm.S Signed and dated1654.\r
\r
On wood:Height,834 inches;length,11/2 inches.\r
##""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

