zac:5739_lot_3_title rdfs:label "SIMON JOHANNES VAN DOUW  Born about 163o. Master in Antwerp 1654. From 1656 to 1657 in the Guild of Middelburg. TWO HORSEMEN WATERING THEIR HORSES AT A FOUNTAIN NEAR A WALL OF ROCKS.  One has dismounted from his spotted white horse, the other,in a blue dress and a white turban, is mounted on a brown mare. In the right foreground a dog;in the distance a farm.S Signed and dated1654.  On wood:Height,834 inches;length,11/2 inches." .

zac:5739_lot_4 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "NICOLAAS (KLAES) MOLENAER  Born evidently at Haarlem,about 163o. From 1651 in the Guild.Died at Haarlem 1676. Pupil of Jacob van  Ruysdael. WINTER LANDSGAPE. A winter scene at the outskirts of a town, seen on the left. A white horse is eating from a box, while beside it is a brown horse; two men are near a sledge. In the left foreground a man is buckling on the skates of another and in the background several people are skating.  On wood:Height,151/ inches;width,1134 inches." ;
    crm:P102_has_title zac:5739_lot_4_title ;
