On the right a group of lions before trees; various remains of ani mals devoured by them in the foreground. On the left,near a high cascade, several panthers, and in the sky a large bird of prey.\r
\r
On wood:Height,151/ inches;length,2814 inches.\r
##""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

