zac:5750_lot_1 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "FLORENTINE SCHOOL. XV CENTURY. MADONNA AND CHILD WITH SAINTS. The enthroned Madonna, hooded and robed in crimson and blue, with the fully clothed Child upon her lap. On the left is St. John the Baptist, and to the right St. Anthony.  Panel:Height,14/ inches; width, 9 inches." ;
