zac:5750_lot_10 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "BARTOLOMEO VIVARINI  Born at Murano, 143o. Brother of Antonio and Alvise Vivarini, who were also painters, but of a very different temperament. Bartolomeo belongs to the great company of followers of Squarcione of Padua. Many of his paintings are dated (second half of the fifteenth century).Died 1499. PIETA. Christ is seen emerging from the tomb, bearing the signs of the Passion..In the background the cross is seen, and at the sides, two angels appear in the clouds, kneeling in prayer. The painting might have formed the base of a picture,but its dimensions permit its being considered an independent work. In an excellent state of preservation. Panel:Height,19 inches; length,29 inches.  The Collection of Gount Albani, Bergamo.  See: A.Venturi, \"La Galleria Crespi di Milano,\" page 55, etc.; Lionello Venturi, \"Le Origini della Pittura Veneziana page 182,etc." ;
    crm:P102_has_title zac:5750_lot_10_title ;
    crm:P138i_has_representation <https://historica.unibo.it/iiif-server/617d9a44-4100-49f8-a622-0de6f2579c68/full/full/0/default.jpg> ;
    crm:P1_is_identified_by zac:5750_lot_10_id ;
    crm:P67i_is_referred_to_by zac:5750_lot_10_description ;
    crm:P94i_was_created_by zac:creation_5750_lot_10 .

zac:5750_lot_10_description a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label """10.PIETA\r
\r
Christ is seen emerging from the tomb, bearing the signs of the Passion..In the background the cross is seen, and at the sides, two angels appear in the clouds, kneeling in prayer. The painting might have formed the base of a picture,but its dimensions permit its being considered an independent work. In an excellent state of preservation.\r
\r
Panel:Height,19 inches; length,29 inches.\r
\r
The Collection of Gount Albani, Bergamo.\r
\r
See: A.Venturi, "La Galleria Crespi di Milano," page 55, etc.; Lionello Venturi, "Le Origini della Pittura Venezianapage""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

