zac:5750_lot_24_description a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label """## 24. MADONNA AND CHILD WITH ANGELS\r
\r
Half-length figure of the holy Mother, robed in a pale crimson tunic and green-blue mantle which is folded around the figure and displays an ivory lining; on her left arm she holds the divine Infant, naively clutching the mantle at His Mother's neck. At either side, in arched formation, is a choir of angels composed of seraphim and cherubim, supporting the crimson canopy with devout mien. The nimbi are delicately wrought in bulino work.\r
\r
Panel:Height,281 inches;width,24 inches.\r
##""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

