    rdfs:label """## 26. MADONNA AND CHILD WITH ANGELS\r
\r
The seated Madonna robed in the traditional colors of crimson and blue, with the Infant Christ seated upon her lap, fully draped and holding a bird with outspread wings.Devout figures of angels appear at either side. The orange covering on the Child and the nimbi are enriched by exquisite bulino work. In a wonderful state ofpreservation.\r
\r
