zac:5750_lot_28_description a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label """## 28.A TRIUMPH\r
\r
The bearded hero is seated in a chariot drawn by two prancing gray steeds;he holds a sword and a book. Armed horsemen surround and follow him; war spoils and a group of oxen precede him. The background depicts a landscape of grayish hills.\r
\r
Height,17/ inches; length,3234 inches.""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

