zac:5750_lot_30_description a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label """30.A TRIUMPH\r
\r
The young hero, holding the commander's baton, is standing in the chariot, drawn by two gray steeds; armed horsemen surround and follow him. A group of fettered prisoners precedes the chariot. The background depicts a landscape of grayish hills.\r
\r
Height,17/ inches;length,3334 inches.\r
\r
See note on No.27.\r
##""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

