zac:5750_lot_31_description a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label """3I.MADONNA AND CHILD\r
\r
Half-length figure of the Virgin Mother, with the seated Child on her lap holding a bird. A pleasing and interesting work; the face of the Mother is especially charming. In a modern tabernacolo.\r
\r
Panel:Height,29 inches;width,18 inches.\r
##""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

