zac:5750_lot_58_description a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label """58.MADONNA AND CHILD\r
\r
The half-length figure of the Madonna is represented with the Child nestling closely to her, with all the grace and in the very decorative manner of this master. In beautiful luminous colors.\r
\r
Panel:Height,32 inches;width,1g inches.\r
\r
Note: This master conducted with Filippo di Giuliano a bottega at San Miniato.\r
##""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416 .

