    rdfs:label "## SPINELLO ARETINO. Florentine School:died 1410  St. Peter and St. Paul. Above, in a medallion, Christ. St. Paul wears a mitre and a red cloak; St. Peter, in a green dress and yellow cloak,holds a book and his key. Gold background.  Ogival panel. Ht.,29 inches. W.,18 inches. Medallion,diameter 4inches.  (Illustrated.)" ;
