zac:5830_lot_39_title rdfs:label "Pier Francesco FIORENTINO  Florence.Painted during last quarter of 15th.century.  The Virgin and Child, with two angels.  The Infant Christ, golden-haired like his Mother, and all but naked, holds a bird in his left hand, its beak to his lips. The Madonna watches him, with a pensive expression of great sweetness.  Good state of preservation.  W.,15inches.  Panel.Ht.,29 inches.W.,18 1/2 inches.  (Illustrated.)" .

