    rdfs:label "BICCI di LORENZO  Florence:I373-I452  Ogival panel. St. John the Baptist, and St. Sebastian. St. John holds a long cross, and is bare-armed and bare-footed. St. Sebastian, carrying a palm-leaf and wearing a crown, is dressed in red and blue embroidered robes. The grass at their feet is full of fowers. Gold background. Fine state of preservation. In the upper part of the panel, the Angel of the Annunciation.  Ht.,56 inches.W.,21 inches.  From the Bardini collection,Florence.  (Illustrated.)" ;
