zac:5830_lot_50 a la:Set ;
    rdfs:label "PIETER BRUEGHEL(the EIder)  Antwerp:1525-1569  A rustic wedding. Signed (bottom,left)Brveghel,1544.  From the Rudolph Kann collection;in the catalogue of which (edited by Messrs.Duveen Bros.;Paris,Igo7, Tome I,no.6) evidently owing to an error in reading the date,the picture is ascribed to Brueghel the Younger,\"after Brueghel the Elder \".The picture is certainly not painted in the manner of the younger Brueghel,and was always knoen, in the Rudolph Kann collection,asa workof Brueghel the Elder:an attribution entirely corroborated byaclose reading of the date.It may be observed that the1644 reading would in any case preclude even Brueghel the younger, who died in 1638.  Panel.Ht.,29 1/2 inches.W.,42 inches. (Illustrated.)" ;
    crm:P102_has_title zac:5830_lot_50_title ;
    crm:P1_is_identified_by zac:5830_lot_50_id ;
