    rdfs:label "Adrian ISENBRANDT  Bruges:1510-1551  Rest on the flight into Egypt.  The Virgin is seated, with the Child, beneath a tree, in a landscape. To the left is a convent;on the right, a stream, with a wooden bridge, and a pretty gabled house. A voluminous red drapery passes over the head of the Madonna, who is suckling the Infant Christ. An open book lies on her knee.. In an excellent state of preservation." ;
